<h2 id="stripping-commas-from-within-blocks-on-export">stripping commas from within blocks on export</h2>
<p>The following commas should not be removed.</p>
<pre><code class="language-r">a &#x3C;- c(1
       , 2
       , 3)
</code></pre>
